#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:2
msgid "Deploy in Air-Gapped Environments"
msgstr "폐쇄망(Air-Gapped) 환경에 배포"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:4
msgid ""
"An air-gapped environment is one that is isolated from the public "
"internet, requiring all necessary components to be available locally. "
"This guide outlines what you'll need to deploy Mattermost in a self-"
"hosted air-gapped environment, focusing on appropriate preparation, "
"deployment guidance and configurations required for a successful "
"deployment."
msgstr ""
"폐쇄망(air-gapped) 환경은 공용 인터넷에서 격리되어 모든 필수 구성 요소가 로컬에 "
"준비되어 있어야 하는 환경입니다. 이 가이드는 셀프 호스팅 폐쇄망 환경에 OKR.BEST를 "
"배포하는 데 필요한 사항을 설명하며, 성공적인 배포에 필요한 적절한 준비, 배포 "
"안내, 구성에 중점을 둡니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:7
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "개요"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:9
msgid ""
"At a high level, deploying Mattermost in an air-gapped environment "
"requires preparing all necessary software, container images, and "
"configuration resources in advance, since the target system has no direct"
" internet access; transferring these artifacts to the isolated network "
"using secure media; and then installing, configuring, and validating the "
"deployment within the air-gapped environment. This is a summary of the "
"steps involved:"
msgstr ""
"개략적으로, 폐쇄망 환경에 OKR.BEST를 배포하려면 대상 시스템에 직접적인 인터넷 "
"접근이 없으므로 필요한 모든 소프트웨어, 컨테이너 이미지, 구성 리소스를 미리 "
"준비하고, 이러한 아티팩트를 보안 매체를 사용해 격리된 네트워크로 전송한 다음, "
"폐쇄망 환경 내에서 배포를 설치·구성·검증해야 합니다. 다음은 관련 단계의 "
"요약입니다:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:11
msgid "**Select your preferred Mattermost deployment option:**"
msgstr "**원하는 OKR.BEST 배포 옵션을 선택합니다:**"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:13
msgid ""
"This step is often dictated by the infrastruture already running in your "
"air-gapped environment. If you're deploying from scratch, we recommend "
"reviewing our :ref:`server deployment documentation <deployment-"
"guide/server/server-deployment-planning:deployment options>` to select "
"the optimal option given your organizations needs."
msgstr ""
"이 단계는 종종 폐쇄망 환경에서 이미 실행 중인 인프라에 의해 결정됩니다. 처음부터 "
"배포하는 경우, 조직의 요구에 맞는 최적의 옵션을 선택하기 위해 :ref:`서버 배포 "
"문서 <deployment-guide/server/server-deployment-planning:deployment options>`"
"\\ 를 검토할 것을 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:15
msgid "**Setup a private container registry or package mirror:**"
msgstr "**비공개 컨테이너 레지스트리 또는 패키지 미러를 설정합니다:**"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:17
msgid ""
"Ideally the air-gapped environment already has a private container "
"registry or package mirror available. If not, we recommend following `our"
" frequently asked questions <#frequently-asked-questions>`__ or "
"referencing online resources specific to your environment."
msgstr ""
"이상적으로는 폐쇄망 환경에 이미 비공개 컨테이너 레지스트리나 패키지 미러가 "
"준비되어 있는 것이 좋습니다. 그렇지 않다면 `자주 묻는 질문 <#frequently-asked-"
"questions>`__\\ 을 따르거나 환경에 맞는 온라인 리소스를 참고할 것을 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:19
msgid "**Prepare your Bill of Materials:**"
msgstr "**자재 명세서(Bill of Materials)를 준비합니다:**"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:21
msgid ""
"Depending on your deployment method method, you'll need to download, tag,"
" and push required materials into your private registry or mirror."
msgstr ""
"배포 방법에 따라 필요한 자재를 다운로드하고 태그를 지정한 다음 비공개 "
"레지스트리나 미러로 푸시해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:23
msgid "**Transfer materials into the air-gapped environment:**"
msgstr "**자재를 폐쇄망 환경으로 전송합니다:**"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:25
msgid ""
"If the private registry cannot access the public internet, you can "
"prepare an archive of the registry data on your internet connected "
"machine and securely transfer it using approved data transfer methods - "
"for example, burning to a disk."
msgstr ""
"비공개 레지스트리가 공용 인터넷에 접근할 수 없다면, 인터넷에 연결된 머신에서 "
"레지스트리 데이터의 아카이브를 준비한 다음 승인된 데이터 전송 방법(예: 디스크에 "
"굽기)을 사용해 안전하게 전송할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:27
msgid "**Install Mattermost Server**"
msgstr "**OKR.BEST 서버 설치**"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:29
msgid ""
"Once you have all the necessary resources in your air-gapped environment,"
" you can move forward with deployment following the instructions for "
":doc:`Linux </deployment-guide/server/deploy-linux>`, :doc:`Kubernetes "
"</deployment-guide/server/deploy-kubernetes>`, or :doc:`Docker "
"</deployment-guide/server/deploy-containers>`."
msgstr ""
"폐쇄망 환경에 필요한 모든 리소스를 갖추면 :doc:`Linux </deployment-guide/server"
"/deploy-linux>`, :doc:`Kubernetes </deployment-guide/server/deploy-"
"kubernetes>`, :doc:`Docker </deployment-guide/server/deploy-containers>` 안내에 "
"따라 배포를 진행할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:31
msgid "**Install Mattermost Desktop Apps**"
msgstr "**OKR.BEST 데스크톱 앱 설치**"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:33
msgid ""
"Since air-gapped devices cannot access the publicly available app stores,"
" you'll need to install the apps directly from the latest `packages "
"available on our GitHub release page "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/desktop/releases>`_. You'll find "
":doc:`installation instructions </deployment-guide/desktop/desktop-app-"
"deployment>` in our documentation based on your desired deployment "
"method."
msgstr ""
"폐쇄망 기기는 공개적으로 제공되는 앱 스토어에 접근할 수 없으므로, `GitHub 릴리스 "
"페이지에서 제공되는 최신 패키지 <https://github.com/mattermost/desktop/releases>"
"`_\\ 에서 직접 앱을 설치해야 합니다. 원하는 배포 방법에 따른 :doc:`설치 안내 "
"</deployment-guide/desktop/desktop-app-deployment>`\\ 는 문서에서 찾을 수 "
"있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:35
msgid "**Configure Mattermost for air-gapped operation**"
msgstr "**폐쇄망 운영을 위해 OKR.BEST 구성**"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:37
msgid ""
"The `configuration settings <#server-configuration>`__ recommended in "
"this document accomodate for the lack of internet access to operate "
"Mattermost in an air-gapped environment."
msgstr ""
"이 문서에서 권장하는 `구성 설정 <#server-configuration>`__\\ 은 폐쇄망 환경에서 "
"OKR.BEST를 운영하기 위한 인터넷 접근 부재를 고려한 것입니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:41
msgid ""
"Consider `talking to a Mattermost expert <https://mattermost.com/contact-"
"sales/>`__ if your organization needs support deploying Mattermost and "
"supporting services in an air-gapped environment."
msgstr ""
"조직이 폐쇄망 환경에 OKR.BEST 및 지원 서비스를 배포하는 데 도움이 필요하다면 "
"`Mattermost 전문가와 상담 <https://mattermost.com/contact-sales/>`__\\ 하는 "
"것을 고려하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:44
msgid "Bill of Materials"
msgstr "자재 명세서(Bill of Materials)"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:46
msgid ""
"On an internet connected machine, you must gather all required packages, "
"container images, and dependencies needed for the installation process. "
"The resources you'll need will depend on your deployment method, "
"specifically:"
msgstr ""
"인터넷에 연결된 머신에서 설치 과정에 필요한 모든 패키지, 컨테이너 이미지, "
"종속성을 수집해야 합니다. 필요한 리소스는 배포 방법에 따라 다르며, 구체적으로 "
"다음과 같습니다:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:50
msgid ""
"Using our provided tarball is recommeded as the simplest installation "
"method for air-gapped environments. You can install the Mattermost Server"
" in a few minutes on any air-gapped 64-bit Linux system."
msgstr ""
"폐쇄망 환경에서 가장 간단한 설치 방법으로 제공된 tarball을 사용하는 것을 "
"권장합니다. 폐쇄망 64비트 Linux 시스템이라면 어디에서나 몇 분 안에 OKR.BEST 서버를 "
"설치할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:52
#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:71
#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:90
msgid "**Prerequisites**"
msgstr "**사전 요구 사항**"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:54
msgid ""
":doc:`Mattermost tarball </product-overview/version-archive>`. We "
"recommend using the latest :ref:`ESR <product-overview/release-"
"policy:extended support releases>` for extended support where server "
"upgrades may be infrequent."
msgstr ""
":doc:`OKR.BEST tarball </product-overview/version-archive>`. 서버 업그레이드가 "
"드물 수 있는 환경에서는 확장 지원을 위해 최신 :ref:`ESR <product-overview"
"/release-policy:extended support releases>`\\ 을 사용할 것을 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:55
msgid ""
"Database: PostgreSQL `installation packages "
"<https://www.postgresql.org/download/>`_ or container images for your "
"Linux distribution"
msgstr ""
"데이터베이스: PostgreSQL `설치 패키지 "
"<https://www.postgresql.org/download/>`_ 또는 Linux 배포판용 컨테이너 이미지"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:56
msgid ""
"File Storage: Local filesystem storage is sufficient for deployments "
"under 2,000 users. For larger deployments requiring high availability, we"
" recommend using an S3-compatible object storage solution or an NFS "
"(Network File System) server for shared storage needs."
msgstr ""
"파일 저장소: 2,000명 미만의 배포에는 로컬 파일 시스템 저장소로 충분합니다. "
"고가용성이 필요한 더 큰 규모의 배포에는 공유 저장소 요구를 위해 S3 호환 오브젝트 "
"스토리지 솔루션이나 NFS(Network File System) 서버 사용을 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:57
msgid ""
"Load balancer: If you already have a load balancer running in your air-"
"gapped environment you can skip this resource, otherwise we recommend "
"deploying :doc:`NGINX </deployment-guide/server/setup-nginx-proxy>` from "
"these `Linux packages <https://nginx.org/en/linux_packages.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"부하 분산기: 폐쇄망 환경에 이미 실행 중인 부하 분산기가 있다면 이 리소스는 "
"건너뛸 수 있으며, 그렇지 않다면 이 `Linux 패키지 "
"<https://nginx.org/en/linux_packages.html>`_\\ 에서 :doc:`NGINX </deployment-"
"guide/server/setup-nginx-proxy>`\\ 를 배포할 것을 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:58
#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:77
#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:95
msgid ""
"Desktop app: Download the `required package "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/desktop/releases>`_ based on your "
"deployment method."
msgstr ""
"데스크톱 앱: 배포 방법에 따라 `필요한 패키지 "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/desktop/releases>`_\\ 를 다운로드하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:60
#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:79
#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:97
msgid ""
"**(Optional) Supporting Services** Consider downloading these additional "
"resources if you plan to enable these optional components:"
msgstr ""
"**(선택 사항) 지원 서비스** 이러한 선택적 구성 요소를 활성화할 계획이라면 다음 "
"추가 리소스를 다운로드하는 것을 고려하세요:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:63
msgid ""
":doc:`Mattermost Calls </administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-"
"guide>`: `mattermost-calls-offloader <https://github.com/mattermost"
"/calls-offloader/releases>`__ (required for recording, transcription and "
"live captions) and `mattermost-rtcd "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/rtcd/releases>`__ (required for "
"performance and scalability)."
msgstr ""
":doc:`OKR.BEST Calls </administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-"
"guide>`: `mattermost-calls-offloader <https://github.com/mattermost/calls-"
"offloader/releases>`__(녹화, 전사, 실시간 자막에 필요) 및 `mattermost-rtcd "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/rtcd/releases>`__(성능 및 확장성에 필요)."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:64
msgid ""
"`Elasticsearch <https://www.elastic.co/downloads/elasticsearch>`__ can be"
" `deployed <https://www.elastic.co/docs/deploy-manage/deploy/self-managed"
"/installing-elasticsearch>`__ for enhanced search performance at scale."
msgstr ""
"대규모에서 향상된 검색 성능을 위해 `Elasticsearch "
"<https://www.elastic.co/downloads/elasticsearch>`__\\ 를 `배포 "
"<https://www.elastic.co/docs/deploy-manage/deploy/self-managed/installing-"
"elasticsearch>`__\\ 할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:65
msgid ""
"`Prometheus <https://prometheus.io/download/>`_ and `Grafana "
"<https://grafana.com/grafana/download>`__ for monitoring and "
"observability"
msgstr ""
"모니터링 및 가관측성을 위한 `Prometheus <https://prometheus.io/download/>`_ 및 "
"`Grafana <https://grafana.com/grafana/download>`__"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:69
msgid ""
"Kubernetes is recommended for a highly scalable and robust deployment if "
"your organization is already running a Kubernetes cluster in the air-"
"gapped environment."
msgstr ""
"조직이 폐쇄망 환경에서 이미 Kubernetes 클러스터를 실행 중이라면, 확장성이 매우 "
"뛰어나고 견고한 배포를 위해 Kubernetes를 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:73
msgid ""
"`Mattermost Operator <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-"
"helm/tree/master/charts/mattermost-operator>`_ and `values "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-helm/blob/master/charts"
"/mattermost-operator/values.yaml>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Mattermost Operator <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-"
"helm/tree/master/charts/mattermost-operator>`_ 및 `values "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-helm/blob/master/charts"
"/mattermost-operator/values.yaml>`__"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:74
msgid ""
"Database: We recommend options such as the `Postgres Operator "
"<https://access.crunchydata.com/documentation/postgres-"
"operator/latest/quickstart>`_ from Crunchy Data, `CloudNativePG <https"
"://cloudnative-pg.io/documentation/1.27/installation_upgrade/>`__ or "
"`pgEdge <https://github.com/pgEdge/pgedge-helm>`__."
msgstr ""
"데이터베이스: Crunchy Data의 `Postgres Operator "
"<https://access.crunchydata.com/documentation/postgres-"
"operator/latest/quickstart>`_, `CloudNativePG <https://cloudnative-"
"pg.io/documentation/1.27/installation_upgrade/>`__ 또는 `pgEdge "
"<https://github.com/pgEdge/pgedge-helm>`__\\ 와 같은 옵션을 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:75
msgid ""
"File Storage: We recommend using an S3-compatible storage service or a "
"mounted NFS volume for shared storage needs."
msgstr ""
"파일 저장소: 공유 저장소 요구를 위해 S3 호환 스토리지 서비스나 마운트된 NFS "
"볼륨 사용을 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:76
msgid ""
"Load balancer: If you already have a load balancer running in your air-"
"gapped environment you can skip this resource, otherwise we recommend "
"deploying :doc:`NGINX </deployment-guide/server/setup-nginx-proxy>`, "
"using the `NGINX Ingress Controller operator <https://docs.nginx.com"
"/nginx-ingress-controller/installation/installing-nic/installation-with-"
"operator/>`__."
msgstr ""
"부하 분산기: 폐쇄망 환경에 이미 실행 중인 부하 분산기가 있다면 이 리소스는 "
"건너뛸 수 있으며, 그렇지 않다면 `NGINX Ingress Controller operator "
"<https://docs.nginx.com/nginx-ingress-controller/installation/installing-"
"nic/installation-with-operator/>`__\\ 를 사용하여 :doc:`NGINX </deployment-"
"guide/server/setup-nginx-proxy>`\\ 를 배포할 것을 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:82
msgid ""
":doc:`Mattermost Calls </administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-"
"guide>` helm charts: `mattermost-calls-offloader "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-helm/tree/master/charts"
"/mattermost-calls-offloader>`__ and `values "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-helm/blob/master/charts"
"/mattermost-calls-offloader/values.yaml>`__ (required for recording, "
"transcription and live captions), `mattermost-rtcd "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-helm/tree/master/charts"
"/mattermost-rtcd>`__ and `values <https://github.com/mattermost"
"/mattermost-helm/blob/master/charts/mattermost-rtcd/values.yaml>`__ "
"(required for performance and scalability)."
msgstr ""
":doc:`OKR.BEST Calls </administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-"
"guide>` helm 차트: `mattermost-calls-offloader "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-helm/tree/master/charts"
"/mattermost-calls-offloader>`__ 및 `values "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-helm/blob/master/charts"
"/mattermost-calls-offloader/values.yaml>`__(녹화, 전사, 실시간 자막에 필요), "
"`mattermost-rtcd <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-"
"helm/tree/master/charts/mattermost-rtcd>`__ 및 `values "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-helm/blob/master/charts"
"/mattermost-rtcd/values.yaml>`__(성능 및 확장성에 필요)."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:83
msgid ""
"`Elasticsearch <https://www.elastic.co/docs/deploy-manage/deploy/cloud-"
"on-k8s>`__ can be `deployed in air-gapped k8 environments "
"<https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/cloud-on-k8s/2.8/k8s-air-gapped.html>`__"
" for enhanced search performance at scale."
msgstr ""
"대규모에서 향상된 검색 성능을 위해 `Elasticsearch "
"<https://www.elastic.co/docs/deploy-manage/deploy/cloud-on-k8s>`__\\ 를 "
"`폐쇄망 k8 환경에 배포 <https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/cloud-on-k8s/2.8/k8s-"
"air-gapped.html>`__\\ 할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:84
msgid ""
"`Prometheus <https://github.com/prometheus-operator/prometheus-"
"operator>`__ and `Grafana <https://github.com/grafana/grafana-"
"operator>`__ operators for monitoring and observability"
msgstr ""
"모니터링 및 가관측성을 위한 `Prometheus <https://github.com/prometheus-"
"operator/prometheus-operator>`__ 및 `Grafana <https://github.com/grafana"
"/grafana-operator>`__ operator"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:88
msgid ""
"Docker can be used if you don't have a running Kubernetes cluster in the "
"air-gapped environment, but want to use containers for simplified "
"installation and dependency management. Docker is not recommended for "
"production environments at high scale, as it doesn’t support clustered "
"deployments or High Availability (HA) configurations out-of-the-box."
msgstr ""
"폐쇄망 환경에 실행 중인 Kubernetes 클러스터가 없지만 간소화된 설치 및 종속성 "
"관리를 위해 컨테이너를 사용하고 싶다면 Docker를 사용할 수 있습니다. Docker는 "
"기본적으로 클러스터 배포나 고가용성(HA) 구성을 지원하지 않으므로 대규모 운영 "
"환경에는 권장되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:92
msgid ""
"`Mattermost Enterprise Edition <https://hub.docker.com/r/mattermost"
"/mattermost-enterprise-edition>`__ image."
msgstr ""
"`Mattermost Enterprise Edition <https://hub.docker.com/r/mattermost"
"/mattermost-enterprise-edition>`__ 이미지."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:93
msgid "Database: `PostgreSQL <https://hub.docker.com/_/postgres>`__ image."
msgstr "데이터베이스: `PostgreSQL <https://hub.docker.com/_/postgres>`__ 이미지."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:94
msgid ""
"Load balancer: If you already have a load balancer running in your air-"
"gapped environment you can skip this resource, otherwise we recommend "
"deploying :doc:`NGINX </deployment-guide/server/setup-nginx-proxy>` from "
"this `images <https://hub.docker.com/_/nginx>`__."
msgstr ""
"부하 분산기: 폐쇄망 환경에 이미 실행 중인 부하 분산기가 있다면 이 리소스는 "
"건너뛸 수 있으며, 그렇지 않다면 이 `이미지 <https://hub.docker.com/_/nginx>`__"
"\\ 에서 :doc:`NGINX </deployment-guide/server/setup-nginx-proxy>`\\ 를 배포할 "
"것을 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:100
msgid ""
":doc:`Mattermost Calls </administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-"
"guide>` images: `calls-offloader <https://hub.docker.com/r/mattermost"
"/calls-offloader>`__ (required for recording, transcription and live "
"captions) and `rtcd <https://hub.docker.com/r/mattermost/rtcd>`__ "
"(required for performance and scalability)."
msgstr ""
":doc:`OKR.BEST Calls </administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-"
"guide>` 이미지: `calls-offloader <https://hub.docker.com/r/mattermost/calls-"
"offloader>`__(녹화, 전사, 실시간 자막에 필요) 및 `rtcd "
"<https://hub.docker.com/r/mattermost/rtcd>`__(성능 및 확장성에 필요)."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:101
msgid ""
"`Elasticsearch <https://hub.docker.com/_/elasticsearch>`__ image for "
"enhanced search performance at scale."
msgstr ""
"대규모에서 향상된 검색 성능을 위한 `Elasticsearch "
"<https://hub.docker.com/_/elasticsearch>`__ 이미지."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:102
msgid ""
"`Prometheus <https://hub.docker.com/r/prom/prometheus>`__ and `Grafana "
"<https://hub.docker.com/r/grafana/grafana>`__ images for monitoring and "
"observability."
msgstr ""
"모니터링 및 가관측성을 위한 `Prometheus "
"<https://hub.docker.com/r/prom/prometheus>`__ 및 `Grafana "
"<https://hub.docker.com/r/grafana/grafana>`__ 이미지."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:105
msgid "Mattermost Plugins"
msgstr "OKR.BEST 플러그인"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:107
msgid ""
"Mattermost includes a number of :doc:`pre-built integrations "
"</integrations-guide/popular-integrations>` for mission-critical tools. "
"If you'd like to use any plugins beyond those that are pre-built in the "
"Mattermost package you'll need to download the plugin binaries from the "
"`Mattermost Marketplace <https://mattermost.com/marketplace/>`_. Once you"
" have Mattermost deployed, these plugin binaries can be uploaded directly"
" in the System Console."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST에는 미션 크리티컬 도구를 위한 여러 :doc:`사전 빌드된 통합 "
"</integrations-guide/popular-integrations>`\\ 이 포함되어 있습니다. OKR.BEST "
"패키지에 사전 빌드된 것 외의 플러그인을 사용하려면 `Mattermost Marketplace "
"<https://mattermost.com/marketplace/>`_\\ 에서 플러그인 바이너리를 "
"다운로드해야 합니다. OKR.BEST를 배포한 후에는 이러한 플러그인 바이너리를 관리자 "
"도구에서 직접 업로드할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:110
msgid "SSL/TLS Certificates and Keys"
msgstr "SSL/TLS 인증서 및 키"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:112
msgid ""
"If your deployment requires SSL, ensure you have the necessary "
"certificates. This includes certificates and keys for enabling HTTPS with"
" Mattermost, as well as any CA files or certificates needed to access "
"internal services such as LDAP or SAML."
msgstr ""
"배포에 SSL이 필요하다면 필요한 인증서를 갖추고 있는지 확인하세요. 여기에는 "
"OKR.BEST에서 HTTPS를 활성화하기 위한 인증서와 키는 물론, LDAP나 SAML 같은 내부 "
"서비스에 접근하는 데 필요한 모든 CA 파일이나 인증서가 포함됩니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:115
msgid "Local Documentation"
msgstr "로컬 문서"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:117
msgid ""
"Mattermost documenation can be `built locally "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/docs?tab=readme-ov-file#build-locally>`__ "
"so you'll have access to installation and configuration documentation in "
"the air-gapped environment. Otherwise, you can download the necessary "
"deployment and configuration documents directly from the `GitHub docs "
"repository <https://github.com/mattermost/docs>`__."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 문서는 `로컬에서 빌드 <https://github.com/mattermost/docs?tab=readme-"
"ov-file#build-locally>`__\\ 할 수 있으므로 폐쇄망 환경에서도 설치 및 구성 문서에 "
"접근할 수 있습니다. 그렇지 않으면 `GitHub docs 저장소 "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/docs>`__\\ 에서 필요한 배포 및 구성 문서를 직접 "
"다운로드할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:119
msgid ""
"**Prerequisites** The following software is required to build the "
"documentation locally:"
msgstr ""
"**사전 요구 사항** 문서를 로컬에서 빌드하려면 다음 소프트웨어가 필요합니다:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:122
msgid "Git `[download] <https://git-scm.com/downloads>`__"
msgstr "Git `[다운로드] <https://git-scm.com/downloads>`__"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:123
msgid "Python 3.11 or later `[download] <https://www.python.org/downloads>`__"
msgstr "Python 3.11 이상 `[다운로드] <https://www.python.org/downloads>`__"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:124
msgid "Pipenv `[download] <https://pipenv.pypa.io>`__"
msgstr "Pipenv `[다운로드] <https://pipenv.pypa.io>`__"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:125
msgid "GNU Make 3.82 or later `[download] <https://ftp.gnu.org/gnu/make/>`__"
msgstr "GNU Make 3.82 이상 `[다운로드] <https://ftp.gnu.org/gnu/make/>`__"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:128
msgid "Server configuration"
msgstr "서버 구성"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:130
msgid ""
"After successful deployment, you'll need to configure Mattermost for air-"
"gapped operation. The following sections describe these configuration "
"options and offers recommendations for settings."
msgstr ""
"배포에 성공한 후에는 폐쇄망 운영을 위해 OKR.BEST를 구성해야 합니다. 다음 섹션에서는 "
"이러한 구성 옵션을 설명하고 설정에 대한 권장 사항을 제시합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:133
msgid "Mobile push notifications"
msgstr "모바일 푸시 알림"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:135
msgid ""
"Mattermost can use mobile push notifications to notify users of new "
"messages and activity. These notifications require a server component to "
"be deployed to send the notifications to the mobile devices. By default, "
"Mattermost will use the public push notification service which is not "
"available in an air-gapped environment. We recommend :ref:`disabling push"
" notifications <administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-"
"settings:enable push notifications>` in **System Console > Environment > "
"Push Notification Server**."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST는 모바일 푸시 알림을 사용해 사용자에게 새 메시지와 활동을 알릴 수 "
"있습니다. 이러한 알림을 모바일 기기로 보내려면 서버 구성 요소가 배포되어 있어야 "
"합니다. 기본적으로 OKR.BEST는 폐쇄망 환경에서 사용할 수 없는 공용 푸시 알림 "
"서비스를 사용합니다. **관리자 도구 > Environment > Push Notification "
"Server**\\ 에서 :ref:`푸시 알림을 비활성화 <administration-guide/configure"
"/environment-configuration-settings:enable push notifications>`\\ 할 것을 "
"권장합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:138
msgid "Email"
msgstr "이메일"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:140
msgid ""
"Unless you have setup an internal air-gapped email service, we recommend "
"disabling email invitations and email verification from **System Console "
"> Authentication > Signup**."
msgstr ""
"내부 폐쇄망 이메일 서비스를 설정하지 않았다면 **관리자 도구 > Authentication > "
"Signup**\\ 에서 이메일 초대와 이메일 인증을 비활성화할 것을 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:143
msgid "Website link previews"
msgstr "웹사이트 링크 미리보기"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:145
msgid ""
"Website link previews require a connection to the internet to fetch the "
"content of the links. We recommend :ref:`disabling website link previews "
"<administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings:enable "
"website link previews>` in **System Console > Site Configuration > "
"Posts**."
msgstr ""
"웹사이트 링크 미리보기는 링크의 내용을 가져오기 위해 인터넷 연결이 필요합니다. "
"**관리자 도구 > Site Configuration > Posts**\\ 에서 :ref:`웹사이트 링크 "
"미리보기를 비활성화 <administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-"
"settings:enable website link previews>`\\ 할 것을 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:148
msgid "GIF picker"
msgstr "GIF 선택기"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:150
msgid ""
"The GIF picker relies on a third-party service which has a dependency on "
"external internet access. You can disable it in **System Console > "
"Integrations > GIF**."
msgstr ""
"GIF 선택기는 외부 인터넷 접근에 의존하는 서드파티 서비스에 의존합니다. **관리자 "
"도구 > Integrations > GIF**\\ 에서 비활성화할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:153
msgid "Notices"
msgstr "알림(Notices)"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:155
msgid ""
":doc:`In-product notices </administration-guide/manage/in-product-"
"notices>` require internet access to periodcally inform administrators "
"and end users of new product improvements, features, and releases. You "
"can disable notices in **System Console > Site Configuration > Notices**."
msgstr ""
":doc:`제품 내 알림 </administration-guide/manage/in-product-notices>`\\ 은 "
"관리자와 최종 사용자에게 새로운 제품 개선 사항, 기능, 릴리스를 주기적으로 알리기 "
"위해 인터넷 접근이 필요합니다. **관리자 도구 > Site Configuration > "
"Notices**\\ 에서 알림을 비활성화할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:158
msgid "Telemetry"
msgstr "텔레메트리"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:160
msgid ""
"To avoid log errors we recommend disabling :doc:`Telemetry-related "
"features </administration-guide/manage/telemetry>`, including the "
"security update check, and error and diagnostics reporting features."
msgstr ""
"로그 오류를 방지하기 위해 보안 업데이트 확인, 오류 및 진단 보고 기능을 포함한 "
":doc:`텔레메트리 관련 기능 </administration-guide/manage/telemetry>`\\ 을 "
"비활성화할 것을 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:163
msgid "Frequently Asked Questions"
msgstr "자주 묻는 질문"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:166
msgid ""
"What if my air-gapped environment doesn't have a private container "
"registry or package mirror?"
msgstr ""
"폐쇄망 환경에 비공개 컨테이너 레지스트리나 패키지 미러가 없으면 어떻게 하나요?"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:167
msgid ""
"A private container registry securely stores the Docker images necessary "
"for air-gapped deployments, ensuring compliance with data isolation "
"requirements. Similarly, a private package mirror stores operating system"
" packages necessary for air-gapped deployments in Ubuntu or RHEL/CentOS "
"Linux environments. Setting up a local registry or mirror is a critical "
"step in deploying Mattermost to ensure all images, dependencies and "
"packages are available to you in the air-gapped environment. The steps "
"below outline the process required to setup a local registry or mirror, "
"depending on the deployment method you are using. These steps are a rough"
" guide, and can be supplemented with online resources depending on your "
"specific deployment needs."
msgstr ""
"비공개 컨테이너 레지스트리는 폐쇄망 배포에 필요한 Docker 이미지를 안전하게 "
"저장하여 데이터 격리 요구 사항 준수를 보장합니다. 마찬가지로 비공개 패키지 미러는 "
"Ubuntu 또는 RHEL/CentOS Linux 환경에서 폐쇄망 배포에 필요한 운영 체제 패키지를 "
"저장합니다. 로컬 레지스트리나 미러를 설정하는 것은 폐쇄망 환경에서 모든 이미지, "
"종속성, 패키지를 사용할 수 있도록 OKR.BEST를 배포하는 데 있어 매우 중요한 "
"단계입니다. 아래 단계는 사용 중인 배포 방법에 따라 로컬 레지스트리나 미러를 "
"설정하는 데 필요한 과정을 설명합니다. 이 단계는 대략적인 가이드이며, 구체적인 "
"배포 요구에 따라 온라인 리소스로 보완할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:172
msgid "**(Ubuntu) Set up a private Debian package mirror**"
msgstr "**(Ubuntu) 비공개 Debian 패키지 미러 설정**"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:174
msgid ""
"We will use Aptly to create a local mirror, although you can also use "
"other options such as debmirror."
msgstr ""
"로컬 미러를 만들기 위해 Aptly를 사용하지만, debmirror 같은 다른 옵션을 사용할 "
"수도 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:176
msgid "**Install Aptly** (on an internet-connected machine):"
msgstr "**Aptly 설치**(인터넷에 연결된 머신에서):"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:183
msgid "**Create GPG key for signing packages**:"
msgstr "**패키지 서명을 위한 GPG 키 생성**:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:189
msgid "**Create a mirror configuration**:"
msgstr "**미러 구성 생성**:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment.rst:195
